OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy rain and strong blustery
OL,6,Fwinds will continue through the
OL,7,Fmorning, before gradually easing in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon, although a few heavy
OL,9,Fshowers are still possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers easing away tonight
OL,12,Fand skies gradually clearing. A mild,
OL,13,Frather muggy night under the cloud at
OL,14,Ffirst, but turning a little chillier
OL,15,Fby dawn in the north.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FDry on Sunday with some patchy
OL,18,Fcloud to start. Increasing amounts of
OL,19,Fsunshine through the afternoon with
OL,20,Flighter winds. Pleasant in the
OL,21,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
